@startuml
title UC5 - Manage Services

start

:1. Select Manage Services;
:2. Choose create / update / delete;

if (3. Select operation?) then (Create)
  :4. Enter service details;
  :5. Save new service;
else (not Create)
  if (Update?) then (Update)
    :6. Modify service details;
    :7. Save updated service;
  else (Delete)
    :8. Select service to delete;
    :9. Remove service;
  endif
endif

:10. Display updated service list;

stop

note right
  Activity Description:
  1. Admin selects the Manage Services option.
  2. Admin chooses to create, update, or delete a service.
  3. System evaluates which operation was selected.
  4. If Create is selected, admin enters service details.
  5. System saves the new service.
  6. If Update is selected, admin modifies service details.
  7. System saves the updated service.
  8. If Delete is selected, admin selects a service to remove.
  9. System deletes the selected service.
  10. System displays the updated list of services.
end note

@enduml